---
---

<section id="stage-brand-message" class="stage-card" style="display: none;" aria-labelledby="message-title">
  <div class="card-header">
    <div class="step-badge">Langkah 3 dari 4: Nilai Kampanye</div>
    <h1 id="message-title" class="title-display">Keahlian di Balik Rasa Mantap</h1>
    <p class="subtitle-text">
      Setiap cita rasa yang mantap bermula dari tanah yang subur, tangan yang terampil, dan dedikasi yang tak pernah kenal kompromi.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="message-visual-box">
    <div class="pillars-grid">
      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 1 10 10c0 5.523-4.477 10-10 10S2 17.523 2 12A10 10 0 0 1 12 2z"></path>
            <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="pillar-title">Ketelitian Waktu</h2>
        <p class="pillar-desc">Pematangan dan pemeraman alami di bawah pantauan ahli berpengalaman.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M20.24 12.24a6 6 0 0 0-8.49-8.49L5 10.5V19h8.5z"></path>
            <line x1="16" y1="8" x2="2" y2="22"></line>
            <line x1="17.5" y1="15" x2="9" y2="15"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="pillar-title">Keahlian Tangan</h2>
        <p class="pillar-desc">Kurasi indrawi dan kepekaan rasa yang diwariskan turun-temurun di Nusantara.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="pillar-card">
        <div class="pillar-icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"></polygon>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h2 class="pillar-title">Rasa Mantap</h2>
        <p class="pillar-desc">Konsistensi perpaduan bahan pilihan yang selalu dapat diandalkan setiap waktu.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="quote-box">
      <p class="quote-text">
        "Dedikasi bukan sekadar menyelesaikan pekerjaan, melainkan menaruh kesungguhan penuh pada setiap detail demi kesempurnaan rasa."
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <button id="btn-to-instructions" class="btn-primary" type="button">
    <span>Pahami Aturan &amp; Mulai Kuis</span>
    <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
      <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
      <polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"></polyline>
    </svg>
  </button>
</section>

<style>
  .stage-card {
    background: var(--surface-card);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border-card);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    padding: var(--space-6);
    box-shadow: var(--card-shadow);
    animation: fadeIn 0.3s ease;
  }

  .step-badge {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .title-display {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    color: var(--text-display);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  .subtitle-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .message-visual-box {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .pillars-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .pillar-card {
    background: var(--surface-subtle);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-input);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
    text-align: left;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease;
  }

  .pillar-card:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-gold-500);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .pillar-icon {
    color: var(--color-gold-500);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .pillar-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--text-display);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .pillar-desc {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .quote-box {
    background: var(--surface-subtle);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-gold-500);
    padding: var(--space-3) var(--space-4);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-input) var(--radius-input) 0;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .quote-text {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text-main);
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 48px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-gold-500) 0%, #a87e2b 100%);
    color: var(--color-brown-950);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    border: none;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    cursor: pointer;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(196, 154, 69, 0.35);
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, filter 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.08);
    box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(196, 154, 69, 0.4);
  }

  .btn-primary:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(6px); }
    to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
</style>
